ure format in the problem. However, their implementation of structural operations on this format appears incorrect.&lt;SEP&gt;Good: The student is working with a 2D array that can represent a graph structure, but the implementation of graph-related algorithms has resulted in an incorrect solution.&lt;SEP&gt;"Graph structures are used to represent data in nodes and edges, modeling relationships among entities."&lt;SEP&gt;"This represents an organizational category of knowledge points related to graph data structures."</data>
