    <node id="&quot;矩阵&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The matrix event refers to the process of manipulating a binary matrix to meet specific conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"矩阵 refers to the n x n grid composed of characters '0' and '1' that needs to be transformed into a 'good matrix'."&lt;SEP&gt;"矩阵 is an event related to defining and transforming a mathematical structure to meet specific conditions, involving rows, columns, and character exchanges."&lt;SEP&gt;"矩阵 is a mathematical arrangement of rows and columns which forms the core subject being examined and manipulated in the context."&lt;SEP&gt;"矩阵 is an n × m arrangement of blocks arranged in rows and columns, with gray blocks that can be broken and blue diagonal blocks that form interconnected groups."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8f4fbb8a3d02558286f8c4e5541d666a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0e2ac3fe25900f76cfe73eedcd9570d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-213863e034cdfa89c3209c59cdabf9c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f38a167365a5d0276ffb59f1c81ca944&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-149cbf20a38db662126124752f186e78</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;01矩阵&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"01矩阵是仅由字符'0'和'1'构成的矩阵，小红需要将其转化为好矩阵。"&lt;SEP&gt;"The 01矩阵 is the organization of a binary matrix with a specific structure that needs to be achieved."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 01矩阵 is the specific matrix given to 小红, composed only of '0' and '1' characters, which needs to be transformed into a 'good matrix'."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7545db3cc1ccecefc971d68863f9d5d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f4fbb8a3d02558286f8c4e5541d666a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-149cbf20a38db662126124752f186e78</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GOOD&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A descriptor indicating the student demonstrates understanding in their error descriptions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Indicates the student's understanding is correct based on the error description."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-37700e6b965dc09fe5f8a9761da4d8f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a074a38ecf5866008803eb9d3c6559bb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BAD&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A descriptor indicating the student has misunderstanding or lack of understanding in their error descriptions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Indicates the student's answer was incorrect based on the error description."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student attempts to simulate the process of string construction but the simulation fails or does not correctly meet the problem's requirements as evidenced by the error description indicating an incorrect answer."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student's approach does not correctly apply greedy strategies for constructing strings that meet the specific lovability criteria. The incorrect result suggests a misunderstanding of when or how to apply greedy choices in string construction."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student's approach likely involves some form of enumeration, but the implementation is flawed. This enumeration does not lead to the correct solution and demonstrates a poor understanding of how to properly enumerate candidates or sort them."&lt;SEP&gt;"There is a fundamental misunderstanding of the control structure needed to properly implement the solution algorithm. The student's code attempts to construct strings but has incorrect logic flow (indicated by the wrong answer) which shows poor grasp of how to structure the program to solve this specific problem."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-3c8d7110bbe4727ef096bd8998e9b640&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37700e6b965dc09fe5f8a9761da4d8f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a074a38ecf5866008803eb9d3c6559bb</data>
    </node>
