    <node id="&quot;MATRIX TRANSFORMATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The act of transforming an existing matrix into a good matrix with specific properties, which is the core task in the problem.&lt;SEP&gt;"The process of converting an existing matrix into a good matrix through a series of adjacent swaps."&lt;SEP&gt;"The event of transforming the given matrix into a good matrix by swapping adjacent characters."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a57838963dbbc9472322e841bbb48518&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44413f301feabb11269b4dc39c5222e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b114d72fb1df4b15a6815afb987ada0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GOOD MATRIX&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A matrix that satisfies specific conditions: even dimensions and a specific quadrant layout of 1's and 0's.&lt;SEP&gt;"good matrix is defined as a matrix meeting specific conditions: even rows/columns and containing 1s only in the top-left region."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specific configuration of a matrix where left upper quadrant is all 1s and other quadrants are all 0s."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-44413f301feabb11269b4dc39c5222e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f38a167365a5d0276ffb59f1c81ca944&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b114d72fb1df4b15a6815afb987ada0</data>
    </node>
