      <data key="d1">"好矩阵 is defined by小红 as a matrix that meets specific conditions: having even row and column counts, and quartered into four equal regions where the top-left is all '1's and the other three regions are all '0's."&lt;SEP&gt;"好矩阵是一个矩阵，满足行数和列数均为偶数，并且将矩阵平分为四个区域后，左上区域全为'1'，其余三个区域全为'0'。"</data>
