      <data key="d1">"左上区域 is one of the four equal regions of the matrix, specifically the top-left quarter which must contain only '1's in a good matrix."&lt;SEP&gt;"左上区域是矩阵平分后的四个区域之一，必须全为'1'才能成为好矩阵。"</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7545db3cc1ccecefc971d68863f9d5d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f4fbb8a3d02558286f8c4e5541d666a</data>
