    </node>
    <node id="&quot;四个区域&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"四个区域 refers to the four equal parts into which the matrix is split for the 'good matrix' definition: left-top, right-top, left-bottom, and right-bottom."&lt;SEP&gt;"四个区域 represents the four equal parts into which the matrix is divided: left-upper, left-lower, right-upper, and right-lower."&lt;SEP&gt;"四个区域是将矩阵平分后的左上、右上、左下、右下四个部分。"</data>
