      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">
炸鸡 is a person and one of the two players in a game of tic-tac-toe (also known as 井字棋) playing against 小L. In this game, 炸鸡 is represented by the 'O' mark on the board, while 小L is likely represented by the 'X' mark. During the game, 炸鸡 granted 小L a special privilege, allowing them to make two consecutive moves or take two steps in a row, which is perceived by some as an arrogant gesture. Additionally, 炸鸡 is also identified as a teacher figure who has taught 小L several new operations, including mathematical operations like squaring and square rooting, as well as bit or bitwise operation knowledge. These roles highlight 炸鸡's involvement both in gaming interactions with 小L and in educational contexts where they imparted various skills and knowledge to 小L.&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 is a player in the tic-tac-toe game using O as their mark. They have given 小L a special privilege, suggesting they have some authority or control in the game."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a376d30d059b09f44ce6681d11e112d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ccb9086dce37a69e62b6fe93d738da78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d34feb8b38494b33de0e8d583302bc5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a51b47f04a5032a9117dced97c6aa7a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bd4eda16155c0a4cb6a2357257e23c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf315318fb9435781f726121555b7204&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2643532bc65acd10b75f38bdb35830ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-478ef0557cc0427a88aeac7c8e7fd593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-740455e328e2f67f25cee018470473d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-649cc18b2d0fdb15683c43c49f191a5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c65c413a0785f44cfb35456d545b19d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-337f6c50a6fc0269c78db8502813c381&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe5877d488b5991002f2148f74e454ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f761857c7438d0e8234494cb00c030e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65da65cd36531d031db5b8f1d3d85dab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f67ee8387c405a64f0344ed9a4a9305e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b256fd1c0676b66deece8e4e49ff37e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c558efa82eea3b35fae76cbadb1eff6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-779b6394c3bf1e24a845e4dbfebf7904</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;小L&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">
小L is a student character who was taught bit operation knowledge by 炸鸡. They are also a person involved in the game of tic-tac-toe, where they are one of the players using the mark 'X' as their symbol. 小L is described as a novice player, currently taking the first move and having the special privilege to take two consecutive steps in one turn at some point during the game. Additionally, 小L is a person who received a number n and wants to transform it into number m, which can be achieved through operations such as multiplying by 2 or taking the integer square root. In their mathematical endeavors, 小L is working on a problem involving three binary numbers a, b, and c, further applying the bit operation knowledge they learned from 炸鸡.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4f761857c7438d0e8234494cb00c030e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e1ff29e648a8e199ea54e1d3f51e580&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dc16b5f321438c090a3a2ab6291f38f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bd4eda16155c0a4cb6a2357257e23c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf315318fb9435781f726121555b7204&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ccb9086dce37a69e62b6fe93d738da78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-649cc18b2d0fdb15683c43c49f191a5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65da65cd36531d031db5b8f1d3d85dab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f67ee8387c405a64f0344ed9a4a9305e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c558efa82eea3b35fae76cbadb1eff6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-779b6394c3bf1e24a845e4dbfebf7904&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-478ef0557cc0427a88aeac7c8e7fd593&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-337f6c50a6fc0269c78db8502813c381&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d34feb8b38494b33de0e8d583302bc5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a51b47f04a5032a9117dced97c6aa7a6</data>
