    <edge source="&quot;INPUT_OUTPUT_AND_SEQUENTIAL_STRUCTURE&quot;" target="&quot;CONTROL_STRUCTURE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">81.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Both knowledge points involve fundamental programming concepts, and the error in the student's program suggests both areas need improvement to achieve correct input/output and conditional logic.")&lt;SEP&gt;"The basic I/O structure supports the control structures needed to solve the problem, but the implementation of control structures contains a logical error in the counting mechanism."&lt;SEP&gt;"The sequential processing relies on control structures to properly iterate through array elements and check conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The control structure (using if statements) is implemented correctly to handle the flow of the program and produce the sequential output structure (the 3x3 matrix)."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student's knowledge of input/output and control structures enabled them to process and manipulate input data correctly."&lt;SEP&gt;"Control Structures govern the sequence and flow of Input/Output operations and sequential execution."&lt;SEP&gt;"The student effectively combines input/output operations with control structures to process the input data and produce an output, though there's an issue with the underlying logic."&lt;SEP&gt;The student's sequential structure is controlled by their control structures (loops and conditionals) to process the matrix step by step.&lt;SEP&gt;"The student's implementation of input/output and sequential structure relies on their control structure implementation, which may contain logical flaws."}&lt;SEP&gt;"The student's control structure implementation doesn't create the proper sequence needed to correctly transform input into output. The flow of operations isn't producing the expected results as indicated by the error."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-530995d49951c45e98e86815187d220e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4c82342f4f53b28de1a354d22719d48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2feb44ce4fa5be3b83426e52f78dce0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02e36ca7c8f7333f04a1da83fdfca6d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2fe3a0bbcef55cf31ca985ee9806595&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0621f867e87fb25088a534465259d65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9370e77c81695b75e64c05cc0a3d5901&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c900fee450edfcc61df8a5dc49da1d44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57aa2fab03045a4f1a94b22bda9b2d8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ede3f2ca6120cc400df50c87dd9d424e</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
