    <edge source="&quot;GOOD MATRIX&quot;" target="&quot;四个区域&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The definition of a 'good matrix' Dictates that the four regions have specific characters: 1s in the left-top and 0s in the other three regions."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f38a167365a5d0276ffb59f1c81ca944</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GOOD MATRIX&quot;" target="&quot;1 '">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The presence of '1' characters in the specific left-top region is a defining characteristic of a 'good matrix'."</data>
