      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GOOD MATRIX&quot;" target="&quot;0 '">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The requirement for '0' characters in all other regions except for the left-top, which must contain '1', is a crucial part of defining a 'good matrix'."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-f38a167365a5d0276ffb59f1c81ca944</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
