    <edge source="&quot;THE MATRIX&quot;" target="&quot;'BLUE MAXIMAL CONNECTED BLOCK'&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The 'blue maximal connected block' is a subset or property of The Matrix, defined based on the arrangement of unbreakable (blue-slashed) blocks within it."&lt;SEP&gt;"The condition of a 'blue maximal connected block' being able to 'drop off' is related to its position and adjacency to breakable (gray) blocks *within* The Matrix."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ad26e515beb14545a407a310ae7ac139</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
