      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The task given to the solver involves analyzing The Matrix to find a 'blue maximal connected block' and calculating the minimum number of breakable blocks to disconnect it. This task is defined based on The Matrix's structure."</data>
      <data key="d5">chunk-ad26e515beb14545a407a310ae7ac139</data>
      <data key="d6">1</data>
    </edge>
