      <data key="d3">121.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"小L and 炸鸡 are opponents engaged in a game of 井字棋, taking turns to place their marks on the board."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L and 炸鸡 are opponents playing a game of Tic-Tac-Toe where they take turns placing their marks on a 3x3 grid."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L and炸鸡 are competing in a tic-tac-toe game against each other, with specific rules and conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 taught Xiao L about bitwise operation knowledge."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 taught 小L about bit operation knowledge, establishing a teacher-student relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 taught 小L two new operations, indicating a teaching relationship between them."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 teaches Little L two new operations, indicating a direct influence and relationship in the context of mathematical operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 taught 小L new operations, establishing a teaching relationship between them."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L and炸鸡 are players in the Tic-Tac-Toe Game, competing against each other."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 deliberately gave 小L an advantage by allowing them to make two consecutive moves once during their game of 井字棋."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 granted 小L a special privilege to make two consecutive moves during the game, which is a strategic advantage in their Tic-Tac-Toe match."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L and 炸鸡 are opponents in the 井字棋 game, taking turns to place their marks on the 棋盘."&lt;SEP&gt;"小L and 炸鸡 are playing each other in a game of tic-tac-toe (井字棋)."&lt;SEP&gt;"炸鸡 gave 小L a special privilege to walk two steps in a row during the game."</data>
